#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:2
msgid "Ad blocking"
msgstr "广告拦截"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:4
msgid ""
"Ad blockers fulfill a legitimate need to mitigate the significant downsides "
"of advertising from tracking across the internet, security implications of "
"third-party code, and impacting the UX and performance of sites."
msgstr "广告拦截器满足了一个正当需求：减轻广告在互联网上追踪带来的诸多弊端、第三方代码的安全隐患，以及对站点用户体验和性能的影响。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:10
msgid ""
"At Read the Docs, we specifically didn't want those things. That's why we "
"built the our :doc:`Ethical Ad initiative <ethical-advertising>` with only "
"relevant, unobtrusive ads that respect your privacy and don't do creepy "
"behavioral targeting."
msgstr ""
"在 Read the Docs，我们明确不希望出现这些问题。这正是我们打造 :doc:`道德广告计划 <ethical-advertising>` "
"的原因——只投放相关、不打扰的广告，尊重你的隐私，不做令人不适的行为定向。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:15
msgid ""
"Advertising is the single largest source of funding for Read the Docs. To "
"keep our operations sustainable, we ask that you either :ref:`allow our "
"EthicalAds <advertising/ad-blocking:Allowing EthicalAds>` or :ref:`go ad-"
"free <advertising/ad-blocking:Going ad-free>`."
msgstr ""
"广告是 Read the Docs 最大的单一资金来源。为保持运营可持续，我们请求你 :ref:`允许我们的 EthicalAds "
"<advertising/ad-blocking:Allowing EthicalAds>` 或 :ref:`选择无广告 <advertising"
"/ad-blocking:Going ad-free>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:22
msgid "Allowing EthicalAds"
msgstr "允许 EthicalAds"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:24
msgid ""
"If you use AdBlock or AdBlockPlus and you allow `acceptable ads`_ or "
"`privacy-friendly acceptable ads`_ then you're all set. Advertising on Read "
"the Docs complies with both of these programs."
msgstr ""
"若你使用 AdBlock 或 AdBlockPlus 并允许了 `acceptable ads`_ 或 `privacy-friendly "
"acceptable ads`_ ，就没问题了。Read the Docs 上的广告符合这两个项目的规定。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:29
msgid ""
"If you prefer not to allow acceptable ads but would consider allowing `ads "
"that benefit open source`_, please consider subscribing to either the wider "
"**Open Source Ads list** or simply the **Read the Docs Ads list**."
msgstr ""
"若你不愿允许 acceptable ads，但愿意考虑允许 `ads that benefit open source`_ ，请考虑订阅更宽泛的 "
"**Open Source Ads 列表** ，或仅订阅 **Read the Docs Ads 列表** 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:34
msgid "`Setup for AdBlock`_"
msgstr "`Setup for AdBlock`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:35
msgid "`Setup for AdBlockPlus`_"
msgstr "`Setup for AdBlockPlus`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:36
msgid "`Setup for uBlock Origin`_"
msgstr "`Setup for uBlock Origin`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:40
msgid ""
"Because of the way Read the Docs is structured where docs are hosted on many"
" different domains, adding a normal ad block exception will only allow that "
"single domain not Read the Docs as a whole."
msgstr "由于 Read the Docs 的结构是文档托管在许多不同域名上，添加常规广告拦截例外只会放行那一个域名，而非整个 Read the Docs。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:53
msgid "Going ad-free"
msgstr "选择无广告"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:55
msgid ""
"`Gold members <https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/gold/>`_ may completely "
"remove advertising for all visitors to their projects. Thank you for "
"supporting Read the Docs."
msgstr ""
"`Gold members <https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/gold/>`_ "
"可以为所有访问其项目的访客彻底移除广告。感谢你对 Read the Docs 的支持。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:61
msgid ""
"Previously, Gold members or `Supporters "
"<https://app.readthedocs.org/sustainability/#donations>`_ were provided an "
"ad-free reading experience across all projects on Read the Docs while "
"logged-in. However, the cross-site cookies needed to make that work are no "
"longer supported by major browsers outside of Chrome, and this feature has "
"been removed."
msgstr ""
"此前，Gold 成员或 `Supporters "
"<https://app.readthedocs.org/sustainability/#donations>`_ 在登录状态下可在 Read the "
"Docs 所有项目中获得无广告阅读体验。但实现该功能所需的跨站 cookie 已不被 Chrome 之外的主流浏览器支持，此功能已被移除。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:69
msgid "Statistics and data"
msgstr "统计数据"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:71
msgid ""
"It can be really hard to find good data on ad blocking. In the spirit of "
"transparency, here is the data we have on ad blocking at Read the Docs."
msgstr "要找到关于广告拦截的可靠数据相当困难。秉持透明精神，以下是我们掌握的 Read the Docs 广告拦截数据。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:75
#, python-format
msgid ""
"`32% of Read the Docs users use an ad blocker <https://blog.readthedocs.com"
"/ads-and-adblocking/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`32% 的 Read the Docs 用户使用广告拦截器 <https://blog.readthedocs.com/ads-and-"
"adblocking/>`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:76
msgid ""
"Of those, `a little over 50% allow acceptable ads "
"<https://blog.readthedocs.com/ad-blocker-update/>`_"
msgstr ""
"其中 `略多于 50% 允许 acceptable ads <https://blog.readthedocs.com/ad-blocker-"
"update/>`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:77
msgid ""
"Read the Docs users running ad blockers click on ads at about the same rate "
"as those not running an ad blocker."
msgstr "运行广告拦截器的 Read the Docs 用户点击广告的比率与未运行拦截器的用户大致相同。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:79
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Comparing with our server logs, roughly 28% of our hits did not register a "
"Google Analytics (GA) pageview due to an ad blocker, privacy plugin, "
"disabling JavaScript, or another reason."
msgstr ""
"对比我们的服务器日志，约 28% 的访问未记录到 Google Analytics（GA）页面浏览，原因可能是广告拦截器、隐私插件、禁用 "
"JavaScript 或其他。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/ad-blocking.rst:82
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Of users who do not block GA, about 6% opt out of analytics on Read the Docs"
" by enabling :ref:`Do Not Track <privacy-policy:Do Not Track>`."
msgstr ""
"在未拦截 GA 的用户中，约 6% 通过启用 :ref:`Do Not Track <privacy-policy:Do Not Track>` "
"选择退出 Read the Docs 的分析。"

